+### Contributor branch workflow
+
+From this repository checkout, start each contribution from a generated branch instead of working directly on `main`:
+
+```bash
+python scripts/contributor_pr.py start feature "short description"
+```
+
+Contributor branches must be named `feature/YYYY_MM_DD_description`, `chore/YYYY_MM_DD_description`, or `fix/YYYY_MM_DD_description`.
+
+When the work is committed, push the contributor branch and open a pull request:
+
+```bash
+python scripts/contributor_pr.py push
+```
+
+After the pull request is merged, return to `main`:
+
+```bash
+python scripts/contributor_pr.py finish --merged --pull
+```
+
 ### Local development
 
 1. Install the command from this repository checkout:
